OL,3,GNEWSAPub could be demolished under
OL,4,Aproposal for flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey pub could soon be knocked down
OL,7,Fto make way for a block of nine flats
OL,8,Fand commercial space.
OL,10,FPlans have been submitted to Elmbridge
OL,11,FBorough Council to demolish The Grove
OL,12,Fpub in Walton-on-Thames, which has been
OL,13,Fempty since 2018.
OL,15,FThe proposed scheme, submitted by
OL,16,FTerrace Ventures, would feature new
OL,17,Fbusiness premises on the ground level,
OL,18,Fwith residential space for nine new
OL,19,Fflats on the floors above, according to
OL,20,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
